WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.335 --> 00:00:03.185
按 localhost 筛选 / Filter by localhost

2
00:00:03.185 --> 00:00:05.979
开启 Recording / Start Recording

3
00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:08.883
建立未解密 TLS 连接 / Establish an opaque TLS connection

4
00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:11.833
选择 CONNECT 隧道 / Select the CONNECT tunnel

5
00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:14.732
查看 Tunnel 而非 HTTP 正文 / Inspect Tunnel rather than an HTTP body

6
00:00:14.732 --> 00:00:17.889
从 Tunnel 打开 HTTPS Setup / Open HTTPS Setup from Tunnel

7
00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:20.882
取消且保持未解密 / Cancel without enabling decryption

8
00:00:20.882 --> 00:00:23.783
打开 Settings / Open Settings

9
00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:26.683
检查已有受信任 CA / Inspect the existing trusted CA

10
00:00:26.683 --> 00:00:29.533
填写自有源站 localhost / Enter the owned origin localhost

11
00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:32.485
仅添加本轮源站例外 / Add only this run’s origin exception

12
00:00:32.485 --> 00:00:35.584
开启 HTTPS 解密 / Enable HTTPS decryption

13
00:00:35.584 --> 00:00:38.482
返回 Capture / Return to Capture

14
00:00:38.482 --> 00:00:41.384
用新连接请求 HTTPS / Request HTTPS over a new connection

15
00:00:41.384 --> 00:00:44.283
选择解密后的 GET / Select the decrypted GET

16
00:00:44.283 --> 00:00:47.434
读取真实 HTTPS 正文 / Read the actual HTTPS body

17
00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:50.334
返回 Settings / Return to Settings

18
00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:53.233
打开 TLS passthrough / Open TLS passthrough

19
00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:56.084
填写精确主机 localhost / Enter the exact host localhost

20
00:00:56.084 --> 00:00:59.034
添加并保存透传条目 / Add and save the passthrough entry

21
00:00:59.034 --> 00:01:02.034
返回 Capture 检查新连接 / Return to Capture to inspect a new connection

22
00:01:02.034 --> 00:01:04.933
重新建立同一源站 HTTPS 连接 / Reconnect to the same HTTPS origin

23
00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:07.830
选择新增 CONNECT / Select the new CONNECT tunnel

24
00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.732
核对命中 TLS passthrough / Verify the TLS passthrough match

25
00:01:10.732 --> 00:01:13.634
从 Tunnel 定位实际名单条目 / Locate the actual entry from Tunnel

26
00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:16.486
删除本轮 localhost 透传项 / Remove this run’s localhost passthrough entry

27
00:01:16.486 --> 00:01:19.434
返回 Capture 检查恢复 / Return to Capture to inspect restoration

28
00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:22.332
再次用新连接请求 HTTPS / Request HTTPS over another new connection

29
00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:25.285
选择恢复解密的 GET / Select the newly decrypted GET

30
00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:28.231
核对 HTTP 正文恢复 / Verify the HTTP body is visible again

31
00:01:28.231 --> 00:01:31.133
返回 Settings 清理本轮配置 / Return to Settings to restore this run’s configuration

32
00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:34.034
打开 Certificates / Open Certificates

33
00:01:34.034 --> 00:01:37.079
关闭本轮解密 / Disable this run’s decryption

34
00:01:37.079 --> 00:01:40.529
移除自有源站例外 / Remove the owned origin exception
